  "label": "User projected onto the man in the suit as a self-identifying online user",
  "description": "The user is projecting themselves onto the man in the suit (man_in_suit) in the meme, identifying with his shyness and desire to engage with content despite social hesitation. This is implied by the text 'i'm shy, but i like stuff' in the third panel, which is a self-deprecating statement that the user sees as relatable. The user is not explicitly using 'me' or 'you' in the text, but the meme format and the self-referential nature of the final panel create a direct identification with the character.",
